zhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1025","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[72,55,65,35,75,60],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15007","armor":"WP1007005","helmet":"WP1025005"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1025","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[72,55,65,35,75,60],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15007","armor":"WP1007005","helmet":"WP1025005"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1025","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[72,55,65,35,75,60],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15007","armor":"WP1007005","helmet":"WP1025005"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10074","city":"CS1025","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[72,55,65,35,75,60],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15007","armor":"WP1007005","helmet":"WP1025005"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"东汉末年与马相共同发动起义的黄巾军领袖。中平五年六月，其与马相在益州绵竹（今四川德阳北）以黄巾军名义起事。聚集受困苦役的百姓，一两天便聚集数千人，先杀绵竹县令李升。队伍迅速壮大到万余人，攻破雒县（今四川广汉），杀益州刺史郤俭；随后攻占蜀郡、犍为郡和巴郡。一个月内连破三郡后，益州从事贾龙组织反击。","tc":"東漢末年與馬相共同發動起義的黃巾軍領袖。中平五年六月，其與馬相在益州綿竹（今四川德陽北）以黃巾軍名義起事。聚集受困苦役的百姓，一兩天便聚集數千人，先殺綿竹縣令李升。隊伍迅速壯大到萬余人，攻破雒縣（今四川廣漢），殺益州刺史郤儉；隨后攻占蜀郡、犍為郡和巴郡。一個月內連破三郡后，益州從事賈龍組織反擊。","en":"A Yellow Turban leader who rose in rebellion alongside Ma Xiang in the late Eastern Han dynasty. In the sixth month of the fifth year of Zhongping (188), he and Ma Xiang rebelled under the Yellow Turban banner in Mianzhu, Yi Province (north of present-day Deyang, Sichuan). Rallying civilians burdened by grueling corvée labor, they gathered several thousand men in just one or two days and first slew Li Sheng, Magistrate of Mianzhu. Their force rapidly swelled to over ten thousand, storming Luo County (present-day Guanghan, Sichuan) and slaying Que Jian, Lt. Governor of Yi Province, they subsequently captured Shu, Qianwei, and Ba Commanderies. After they breached three commanderies within a single month, Jia Long, an Attendant Officer of Yi Province, organized a counter.","jp":"後漢末期、馬相とともに蜂起した黄巾軍の首領。中平五年（188年）六月、馬相とともに益州綿竹（現在の四川省徳陽の北）にて黄巾軍を称して挙兵した。労役に苦しむ民を結集し、わずか一、二日で数千人を集め、まず綿竹県令の李升を殺害した。勢力は瞬く間に一万余人に膨れ上がり、雒県（現在の四川省広漢）を破って益州刺史の郤倹を殺害、次いで蜀郡・犍為郡・巴郡を攻め落とした。一カ月のうちに立て続けに三郡を破った後、益州従事の賈龍が反撃を組織した。","kr":"동한 말기 마상과 함께 봉기한 황건군의 수령. 중평 5년 6월, 마상과 함께 익주 면죽(지금의 쓰촨 더양 북쪽)에서 황건군의 명의로 봉기했다. 고역에 시달리던 백성들을 규합해 불과 하루이틀 만에 수천 명을 모았고, 먼저 면죽현령 이승을 죽였다. 무리는 순식간에 만여 명으로 불어나 낙현(지금의 쓰촨 광한)을 함락하고 익주자사 극검을 죽였으며, 이어 촉군, 건위군, 파군을 점령했다. 한 달 만에 세 군을 연이어 무너뜨리자, 익주종사 가룡이 반격에 나섰다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1051515","remark":"普武","surname":"赵","surnameTc":"趙","surnameEn":"Zhao","surnameJp":"趙","surnameKr":"조","surnameOther":"","name":"祗","nameTc":"祗","nameEn":"Zhi","nameJp":"祗","nameKr":"지","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"赵祗","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"3","workYear":"184","city":"CS1025","gender":"0","rule":"72","force":"55","wise":"65","politics":"35","charm":"75","will":"60","ruleTalent":"9","forceTalent":"11","wiseTalent":"4","politicsTalent":"4","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"70/26/29/30/27/27/31/28","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"1003402","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1012105","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5600